 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you doing? I use a front basket or a backpack. The front basket fits under the down tube and doesn't tip the bike. Baskets work, but they' heavy. A backpack takes a bit of getting used to, and you need a good backpack made for bike panniers. That works well as long as you take it off before you lock the bike. Most security guys can't hack it off. Not at all. It breathes bit through the shoulder straps, so you need little fan at the end.",
